[h2]Toxeus the Murderer, Devourer of Blood drops his soul[/h2]
[list]
[*]The Devourer's soul was set to a 100% drop and still did not drop. His database was correct; the guarantee rode a single engine channel on a single record with no backup. He now carries a second guaranteed channel on a slot the engine is proven to read, measured at 100% on all three difficulties.
[*]While that fix is confirmed in play, he may drop his soul twice on a kill. One soul means the original channel was dead and the fix carried it; two means it was never the problem. Either way it will be tightened in the next update. He no longer drops his potion, which made room for the soul.
[/list]
[h2]A wider bug, found and logged[/h2]
[list]
[*]Several guaranteed boss drops in this mod were wired to an equipment slot the engine does not have, so they could never drop: among them the Golden Bough, Lethe's Draught, the Mask of Dread and the Toxeus rite formula. The cause is one shared helper and it is fixed in the next update, not this one.
[/list]
[h2]Housekeeping[/h2]
[list]
[*]Deploy-time backups moved off the working drive with rotation. No player-facing change.
[/list]
